        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player will start the game by equipping 1 weapon and 1 ability from inside the preparation room, once both players ready up they are transported into the arena where they will duel. Players can use the arena to their advantage by interacting with scattered powerups, knocking down environmental hazards or pushing their opponent in lava. The first player to reach 3/5/7 points will be crowned the winner of the duel. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axe - Leap aggressively into fights burning the ground wherever you land, the axe is the most aggressive of the weapons designed to maintain a heavy offence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spear - Set traps for your opponent and hurl spears of lightning at your enemy, best at keeping distance the spear is for those who prefer to play more defensively.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword - Use your superior skill to outplay any opponent with using high mobility dashes and jumps, the sword is intended as the most flexible weapon, for both attack and defence.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash - Weave in a dash between any ability in the game, the most skilled users create new combos by themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hook- Grapple your self quickly anywhere in the arena, safely repositioning in a tight spot, alternatively pull any opponent in that is trying to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repulsor Shield - Create a shield around yourself that can deflect any attack in the game with the right timing.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player will start the game by equipping 1 weapon and 1 ability from inside the preparation room, once both players ready up they are transported into the arena where they will duel. Players can use the arena to their advantage by interacting with scattered powerups, knocking down environmental hazards or pushing their opponent in lava. The first player to reach 3/5/7 points will be crowned the winner of the duel. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axe - Leap aggressively into fights burning the ground wherever you land, the axe is the most aggressive of the weapons designed to maintain a heavy offence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spear - Set traps for your opponent and hurl spears of lightning at your enemy, best at keeping distance the spear is for those who prefer to play more defensively.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword - Use your superior skill to outplay any opponent with using high mobility dashes and jumps, the sword is intended as the most flexible weapon, for both attack and defence.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash - Weave in a dash between any ability in the game, the most skilled users create new combos by themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hook- Grapple your self quickly anywhere in the arena, safely repositioning in a tight spot, alternatively pull any opponent in that is trying to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repulsor Shield - Create a shield around yourself that can deflect any attack in the game with the right timing.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Battle your friends in fast-paced 1v1 arena brawler style duels. Choose from axe, sword, or spear, each with its own strengths, and fight through intense rounds. Outplay your opponent, become champion of the arena, and earn the title of Duelmaster!",
